Context: 1. Income from Salary

- Contribution to any Pension Fund set up by any Mutual Fund;
- (x) Subscription to any such Deposit Scheme of National Housing Bank as may be notified by Central Government;
- (xi) Subscription to any such deposit scheme of a public sector company of any authority constituted in India which is engaged in long-term financing for construction / purchase of houses for residential purposes or any authority constituted in India for purpose of planning, develop ment, improvement of cities, etc.
